---
<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-ink-900 py-24 text-cream-100 sm:py-32">
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0">
    <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-[34rem] w-[34rem] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-teal-600/20 blur-[130px]"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 text-center sm:px-8">
    <img src="/brand/mark-white.png" alt="" width="180" height="190" class="mx-auto h-14 w-auto" aria-hidden="true" />
    <h2 class="mt-6 font-heading text-[clamp(2rem,4.4vw,3.4rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-balance">
      Give your patients a reason to come back, and a reason to bring a friend.
    </h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-cream-100/70">
      Start free, and watch aftercare turn into retention, reviews, and referrals, in weeks, not quarters.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-9 flex flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
      <a href="/start" data-cta="cta-start" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500 px-7 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-ink-900 hover:bg-teal-400 transition-colors min-h-[52px]">
        Start free trial
      </a>
      <a href="/contact" data-cta="cta-demo" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 px-7 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors min-h-[52px]">
        Book a demo
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-6 text-xs text-cream-100/50">14 days free | No credit card | HIPAA-aligned | Cancel anytime</p>
  </div>
</section>
